  - id: peter_2peter
    displayName: The Eyewitness of the Holy Mount
    flavorText: Peter grounds his final teaching not in clever fables but in his
      own eyes and ears, recalling the day he stood on the holy mountain and heard
      the voice from heaven declare, 'This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.'
