  - id: virtue_ladder_2peter
    displayName: Add to Your Faith
    flavorText: Peter lays out a rising chain of virtue upon virtue - faith, virtue,
      knowledge, temperance, patience, godliness, brotherly kindness, and charity
      - so that none who possess them will be barren or unfruitful in the knowledge
      of Christ.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Instructs believers to add to their faith a progressive chain of virtues
      (virtue, knowledge, temperance, patience, godliness, brotherly kindness, charity)
      so that they be neither barren nor unfruitful, and so make their calling and
      election sure; warns that lacking these things leaves one blind and forgetful
      of past cleansing from sin.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_2peter
    managerId: virtue_ladder_2peter
    icon: {fileID: 0}
