  - id: false_teachers_2peter
    displayName: Wells Without Water
    flavorText: Peter unmasks the false teachers rising among the church as wells
      without water and clouds carried by a tempest, warning that just as God judged
      the fallen angels, the ancient world, and Sodom and Gomorrha, He also knows
      how to reserve the unjust unto judgment.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Warns the church that false teachers will rise among them just as false
      prophets rose among Israel, secretly bringing in damnable heresies and exploiting
      believers through feigned words and covetousness; establishes God's certain
      pattern of judging the unrighteous while delivering the godly, and vividly
      describes the false teachers' immorality, presumption, and inevitable destruction.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_2peter
    managerId: false_teachers_2peter
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 6082.201995573398
